tools:['3M 77','Nosecone & canopy pieces','Tail boom pieces','Nosecone template','Long knife or saw','100/220/320 grit','Epoxy'],
tip:'Make sure the boom blocks fit tight against the stabilator pivot tubes — they add significant strength to the stabilator pivots.',
check:['All laminations closed before shaping','Nosecone finished to 320 grit','Boom channels clear the tubes, tubes tight against them','Trailing edges feathered to match']},
{n:'10',t:'Flaperons, fins & rudders',p:[14,15],intro:'Flying surfaces: tape-hinged flaperons, fins on the dihedral jigs, optional rudders.',what:[
