tools:['3M Satin tape','Flaperon servos, horns, pushrods','Fin supports','Foam jigs','Epoxy & microballons','Pins','Rudder servo (opt)','Sullivan pushrods (opt)','1/32" wire (opt)'],
tip:'Rudders are optional but help at high alpha and for aerobatics. Use a 90° servo arm and make sure the pushrods meet it at 90° at neutral so both rudders deflect equally.',
